American Academy of Orthopaedic Surgeons, OrthoInfo. Shoulder Pain and Common Shoulder Problems. English; article written or reviewed by an ASES member.

[Authorized source](https://www.orthoinfo.org/diseases--conditions/shoulder-pain-and-common-shoulder-problems/).

A public-facing overview of anatomy, common problem categories, history, examination, and general treatment discussions. Use it as an introduction; read current condition-specific evidence before treating a simplified mechanism as a complete explanation.

